    "**THE SAME ROSTER'S HEADER ALREADY RECORDS THE ANCESTOR OF THIS MISTAKE**, which is why it is a class: 101 rows were held there as agreement while never reaching their subject, and were reclassified into `v2.workflow.floor_route_gap` on 2026-08-20 once `ExpectedRedArm` was taught to refuse `HostEffectRefused`, `HostToolUnresolved` and an interrupted budget.",

    "That repair closed the arm where a NON-VERDICT was read as agreement; this class is the same harm one step earlier, where a row never reaches an arm at all and a sentence promises it will.",

